{"id":"resumen","lemma":"resumen","pos":"noun","rank":3762,"glosses":["summary, abstract","résumé, curriculum vitae"],"ipa":"/reˈsumen/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"resúmenes"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/35/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-resumen.wav","examples":[{"text":"Aquí tienes un breve resumen.","en":"Here is a brief explanation.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/518678","words":[{"g":"here"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"brief, short"},null]},{"text":"La reunión fue, en resumen, una pérdida de tiempo.","en":"The meeting, in short, was a waste of time.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"meeting"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"in / on"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"loss"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"time"}]},{"text":"Ella le dijo que reescribiera su resumen.","en":"She told him to rewrite his resume.","words":[{"g":"she"},{"g":"him / her"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},{"g":"that"},null,{"g":"his / her / your"},null]}]}